<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Dive into workshops with world-class teachers, hit the dance floor for social dances, and let live music sweep you off your feet. From Lindy Hop to solo jazz and more, SwingDom is your ticket to groove to vintage tunes, meet fellow swing lovers, and soak up the rich, soulful culture of swing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
